<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cricket-Sri Lanka bowl out New Zealand for 222.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sri Lanka bowl out New Zealand for 222.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out for 222 at close of play on the first day of the second cricket test against Sri Lanka on Friday.</p>
<p>Score:</p>
<p>New Zealand 222 (B. Pocock 85, M. Muralitharan 3-43, N. Zoysa 3-47)</p>
